The above assert statement is being generated for: 

<code>
// @@@ last index of x in the list increases when x is added
</code>

From the code sample provided, the comment that starts with "@@@" has been used to generate the assert statement. The list at the last index being added 'x' to the list will not be null.--------------------
Debug.Assert(_originalList.Count + 3 == _clone.Count); 
</code>
```cs
var _originalList = new ArrayList();
var _clone = new ArrayList();

for(int i = 0; i < 3; i++) {
    _originalList.Add(i);
    _clone.Add(i);
}
