In the initial `ArrayList`, if you want to access the last element, you will need to use index -1 while in the debug statement it should be written this way due to it is not negative and it is the same as `ArrayList[4]`: <code>Debug.Assert(_originalList[^1] == 4);</code>

<code>Debug.Assert(_clone[0] == 1);</code>
